<string_table>
	<string id="st_rz_brd_dlg_0">
		<text>Can you breed an artefact for me?</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_rz_brd_dlg_29">
		<text>Never mind.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_rz_brd_dlg_35">
		<text>I don't have that much money on me.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_rz_brd_dlg_39">
		<text>I'll think about it.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_rz_brd_intro">
		<text>Show me what you've got. I work with %s.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_rz_brd_none">
		<text>You have nothing I could work with. I work with %s. I don't open containers - take the artefact out first.</text>
	</string>
