	</string>
	<string id="st_rz_brd_offer_base">
		<text>%s. I can grow it to a higher tier (T1 to T3) - its own effects get stronger and it emits less radiation. Each next tier costs more and builds on the previous one.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_rz_brd_offer_next">
